OL,3,C'It's like a sand-storm': the locals
OL,4,Cwho say they're living with dust clouds
OL,6,FPeople living near a major housing
OL,7,Fdevelopment say they are inhaling
OL,8,F'dirt' as a result of dust clouds
OL,9,Fblowing into their street.
OL,11,FThe Plasdwr construction plans were
OL,12,Ffirst submitted in 2014. Described as
OL,13,F'Cardiff's garden city', building
OL,14,Fbegan in the north-west part of the
OL,15,Fcity in 2017.
