OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1785431952
OL,3,C'It's like a sand-storm': the locals
OL,4,Cwho say they're living with dust clouds
OL,6,FBut since the start of the summer
OL,7,Fholidays, when the country has been in
OL,8,Fthe midst of a prolonged dry spell,
OL,9,Fthose living in Pentrebane have raised
OL,10,Fconcerns about dust infiltrating their
OL,11,Fhomes when windows are open.
OL,13,FJacob Sparkes, an affected resident,
OL,14,Fsaid he is desperate for rain to fall
OL,15,Fto tackle the dust and is worried that
OL,16,Fbasic environmental controls have not
OL,17,Fbeen enforced.
OL,19,FHe said he has been in correspondence
OL,20,Fwith the regulators of the site in an
OL,21,Fattempt to resolve the issue.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/8
