PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1785431952
OL,3,C'It's like a sand-storm': the locals
OL,4,Cwho say they're living with dust clouds
OL,6,FJacob describes the situation as
OL,7,F"living in a sand-storm".
OL,9,FMeanwhile another resident, who does
OL,10,Fnot want to be named, has chronic
OL,11,Fobstructive pulmonary disease (COPD)
OL,12,Fand is worried about the impact it
OL,13,Fcould have on their health.
OL,15,FCOPD is a condition that affects the
OL,16,Flungs and can cause a shortness of
OL,17,Fbreath, a persistent cough, chest
OL,18,Finfections, and persistent wheezing.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/8
