PN,43604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1785431952
OL,3,C'It's like a sand-storm': the locals
OL,4,Cwho say they're living with dust clouds
OL,6,FJoseph Carter, the Head of Devolved
OL,7,FNations for Asthma + Lung UK, told ITV
OL,8,FNews that in the short-term,
OL,9,Fconstruction dust can exacerbate the
OL,10,Fcondition and lead to hospitalisation.
OL,12,FHe also warned that over a long period
OL,13,Fof time, construction dust can "lead
OL,14,Fto horrendous lung conditions" such as
OL,15,Fsilicosis.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/8
