OL,3,C'It's like a sand-storm': the locals
OL,4,Cwho say they're living with dust clouds
OL,6,FA spokesperson from Barratt Redrow
OL,7,Fsaid "While we have not received any
OL,8,Fdirect complaints from local residents
OL,9,Fregarding dust, we are working in
OL,10,Faccordance with the approved
OL,11,FConstruction and Environmental
OL,12,FManagement Plan.
OL,14,F"Following a visit to the site, the
OL,15,Flocal authority was satisfied with the
OL,16,Fdust mitigation measures in place and
OL,17,Fdid not require any further follow-up.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/8
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
