OL,3,C'It's like a sand-storm': the locals
OL,4,Cwho say they're living with dust clouds
OL,6,F"We have a range of measures in place
OL,7,Fto minimise dust, including dampening
OL,8,Fworking areas, using dust suppression
OL,9,Ftechniques, deploying road sweepers
OL,10,Fand retaining as much existing
OL,11,Fvegetation on site as is safe and
OL,12,Fpractical."
OL,14,FAccording to Barratt Redrow's
OL,15,FConstruction Environmental Management
OL,16,FPlan (CEMP) for the site, includes
OL,17,Fmeasures to mitigate dust including:
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G6/8
