OL,3,C'It's like a sand-storm': the locals
OL,4,Cwho say they're living with dust clouds
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Cardiff Council,
OL,7,Fwho regulate the site, said: "Officers
OL,8,Ffrom Shared Regulatory Services were
OL,9,Fcontacted last week by a local
OL,10,Fresident regarding reports of dust
OL,11,Femissions associated with the site.
OL,13,F"Following this, officers contacted
OL,14,Fthe developer and agreed a series of
OL,15,Fadditional mitigation measures aimed
OL,16,Fat reducing the impact of dust. The
OL,17,Feffectiveness of these measures will
OL,18,Fbe monitored on an ongoing basis".
